    "cycleDescription": "Certified organic production systems may also be either single- or multi-tier systems (where hens live either directly on the floor or within an aviary structure, with access to perches, nest and scratch areas, and other enrichments) that adhere to additional requirements for production (for example exposure to natural light) set by the Canadian General Standards Board (CGSB)",
